DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/audio/{audio_identifier}
Deletes additional audio tracks on a video. Deleting a default audio track is not allowed. You must assign another audio track as default prior to deletion.
Required: account_id (path); identifier (path); audio_identifier (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/audio/{audio_identifier}
Edits additional audio tracks on a video. Editing the default status of an audio track to `true` will mark all other audio tracks on the video default status to `false`.
Required: account_id (path); identifier (path); audio_identifier (path); body (body)

POST /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/downloads/{download_type}
Creates a download for a video of specified type. For backwards-compatibility, POST requests to /downloads will enable the default download.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path); download_type (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/downloads/{download_type}
Delete specific type of download. For backwards-compatibility, DELETE requests to /downloads will delete the default download.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path); download_type (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/live_inputs/{live_input_identifier}
Permanently delete a live input, making it inaccessible and blocking current and future broadcasts to it. Existing recordings will be retained.
Required: live_input_identifier (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/live_inputs/{live_input_identifier}/outputs/{output_identifier}
Deletes an output and removes it from the associated live input.
Required: output_identifier (path); live_input_identifier (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/live_inputs/{live_input_identifier}
Retrieves details of an existing live input.
Required: live_input_identifier (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/live_inputs/{live_input_identifier}
Updates a specified live input.
Required: live_input_identifier (path); account_id (path); body (body)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/live_inputs/{live_input_identifier}/outputs/{output_identifier}
Updates the state of an output.
Required: output_identifier (path); live_input_identifier (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/keys/{identifier}
Deletes signing keys and revokes all signed URLs generated with the key.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/captions/{language}
Removes the captions or subtitles from a video.
Required: language (path); identifier (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/captions/{language}
Lists the captions or subtitles for provided language.
Required: language (path); identifier (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}/captions/{language}
Uploads the caption or subtitle file to the endpoint for a specific BCP47 language. One caption or subtitle file per language is allowed.
Required: language (path); identifier (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}
Deletes a video and its copies from Cloudflare Stream.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}
Fetches details for a single video.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path)

POST /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/{identifier}
Edit details for a single video.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/watermarks/{identifier}
Deletes a watermark profile.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/stream/watermarks/{identifier}
Retrieves details for a single watermark profile.
Required: identifier (path); account_id (path)
